{"4346810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Only One Night", "steam_appid": 4346810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a kid is abandoned by his parents and left alone for a day, they start to go insane and start seeing creatures of their own nightmares. Driven by sleep deprivation, they must manage their energy and take quick naps while surviving against the never ending threats to survive only one night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only One night is a <strong>Fnaf-Like </strong>game with <strong>Rogue-Like</strong> elements such as enemy scaling and powerups. Instead of the usual night formula the game is split into many fast paced hours, and you must manage your energy by taking naps which leave you vulnerable. Every hour you can get a powerup which can be as small as a stat up or the ability to parry the nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Only One Night</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is inspired by many <strong>Rogue-likes</strong> such as Binding of Isaac, Fnaf, and it's many Fan Games, such as One More Night (Roblox) and Too Many Nights. The game was made previously for a Game jam with the theme &quot;Only One&quot;, and was originally released with a v1 demo. The game has been polished ever since, with many new features such as enhanced music, sounds, sprites, and a more refined gameplay loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive 12 Hours that get more difficult</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ Achievements to collect</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive using a variety of powerups</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/d7a4bc7181bfe801f2bba016cafc451f.avif?t=1770970718\" width=1380 height=376 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Hour</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plushies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/c64c1f694250bf8904b17ee31b26da2f.webp?t=1770970718\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/1360095213ed6e4d0e1d75f9358ad28a.webp?t=1770970718\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/126cd4bb14a5548f3569e7db94207f7c.webp?t=1770970718\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/d37e5e01ef9ee32ec461c1ee597d7e0d.webp?t=1770970718\" width=32 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/b6e70ccbf9536da3ac4169c57f9dc050.webp?t=1770970718\" width=32 height=32 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And References + Easter Eggs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4346810/extras/cf31ef92e2aff55a3204613f421bc3cb.avif?t=1770970718\" width=796 height=399 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a kid is abandoned by his parents and left alone for a day, they start to go insane and start seeing creatures of their own 